              "children": [],
              "isExpanded": true,
              "parentId": "db8cd202-5504-4e91-9ce0-9d967554b7db",
              "data": {
                "note": "**层** 目标\n\n**类型** theorem\n\n**模块** `Init.Data.List.Basic`\n\n**角色** 目标定理\n\n**签名**\n```lean\n∀ {α : Type u} {as bs : List α}, (as ++ bs).length = as.length + bs.length\n```\n\n**文档**\n（无 docstring）",
                "tags": [
                  "declaration",
                  "目标",
                  "theorem"
                ]
              },
              "style": {
                "background": "#2563eb",
                "color": "#ffffff",
                "fontWeight": "bold",
