          }
        },
        {
          "id": "247b37bd-a58c-4394-a6fb-1bd846172bc5",
          "text": "读懂陈述",
          "children": [
            {
              "id": "2873e362-9a0e-4ffc-b755-8f58dd73121e",
              "text": "等式与同余",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "77d60964-7d6b-4bf1-bf6e-2fc2499c28e6",
                  "text": "[陈述] Eq",
                  "children": [],
                  "isExpanded": true,
                  "parentId": "2873e362-9a0e-4ffc-b755-8f58dd73121e",
                  "data": {
                    "note": "**层** 陈述\n\n**类型** inductive\n\n**模块** `Init.Prelude`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\n{α : Sort u_1} → α → α → Prop\n```\n\n**文档**\nThe equality relation. It has one introduction rule, `Eq.refl`.\nWe use `a = b` as notation for `Eq a b`.\nA fundamental property of equality is that it is an equivalence relation.\n```\nvariable (α : Type) (a b c d : α)\nvariable (hab : a = b) (hcb : c = b) (hcd : c = d)\n\nexample : a = d :=\n  Eq.trans (Eq.trans hab (Eq.symm hcb)) hcd\n```\nEquality is much more than an equivalence relation, however. It has the important property that every assertion\nrespects the equivalence, in the sense that we can substitute equal expressions without changing the truth value.\nThat is, given `h1 : a = b` and `h2 : p a`, we can construct a proof for `p b` using substitution: `Eq.subst h1 h2`.\nExample:\n```\nexample (α : Type) (a b : α) (p : α → Prop)\n        (h1 : a = b) (h2 : p a) : p b :=\n  Eq.subst h1 h2\n\nexample (α : Type) (a b : α) (p : α → Prop)\n    (h1 : a = b) (h2 : p a) : p b :=\n  h1 ▸ h2\n```\nThe triangle in the second presentation is a macro built on top of `Eq.subst` and `Eq.symm`, and you can enter it by typing `\\t`.\nFor more information: [Equality](https://lean-lang.org/theorem_proving_in_lean4/quantifiers_and_equality.html#equality)",
                    "tags": [
                      "declaration",
                      "陈述",
                      "inductive"
                    ]
                  },
                  "style": {
                    "background": "#f8fbff",
                    "color": "#1e3a8a",
                    "fontSize": 13,
                    "borderColor": "#93c5fd"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "db90b1e6-43d3-4ca9-851b-534e969d58fb",
                  "text": "[证明] Eq.rec",
                  "children": [],
                  "isExpanded": true,
                  "parentId": "2873e362-9a0e-4ffc-b755-8f58dd73121e",
                  "data": {
                    "note": "**层** 证明\n\n**类型** recursor\n\n**模块** `Init.Prelude`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\n{α : Sort u_1} → {a : α} → {motive : (a_1 : α) → a = a_1 → Sort u} → motive a ⋯ → {a_1 : α} → (t : a = a_1) → motive a_1 t\n```\n\n**文档**\n（无 docstring）",
                    "tags": [
                      "declaration",
                      "证明",
                      "recursor"
                    ]
                  },
                  "style": {
                    "background": "#f7fef9",
                    "color": "#14532d",
                    "fontSize": 13,
                    "borderColor": "#86efac"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "ebae935d-a21a-4512-bbcf-30542b9970cb",
                  "text": "[证明] Eq.refl",
                  "children": [],
                  "isExpanded": true,
                  "parentId": "2873e362-9a0e-4ffc-b755-8f58dd73121e",
                  "data": {
                    "note": "**层** 证明\n\n**类型** constructor\n\n**模块** `Init.Prelude`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\n∀ {α : Sort u_1} (a : α), a = a\n```\n\n**文档**\n`Eq.refl a : a = a` is reflexivity, the unique constructor of the\nequality type. See also `rfl`, which is usually used instead.",
                    "tags": [
                      "declaration",
                      "证明",
                      "constructor"
                    ]
                  },
                  "style": {
                    "background": "#f7fef9",
                    "color": "#14532d",
                    "fontSize": 13,
                    "borderColor": "#86efac"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "09dfd513-38c6-432e-9f5d-445a6e6851a1",
                  "text": "[证明] Eq.symm",
                  "children": [],
                  "isExpanded": true,
                  "parentId": "2873e362-9a0e-4ffc-b755-8f58dd73121e",
                  "data": {
                    "note": "**层** 证明\n\n**类型** theorem\n\n**模块** `Init.Prelude`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\n∀ {α : Sort u} {a b : α}, a = b → b = a\n```\n\n**文档**\nEquality is symmetric: if `a = b` then `b = a`.\n\nBecause this is in the `Eq` namespace, if you have a variable `h : a = b`,\n`h.symm` can be used as shorthand for `Eq.symm h` as a proof of `b = a`.\n\nFor more information: [Equality](https://lean-lang.org/theorem_proving_in_lean4/quantifiers_and_equality.html#equality)",
                    "tags": [
                      "declaration",
                      "证明",
                      "theorem"
                    ]
                  },
                  "style": {
                    "background": "#f7fef9",
                    "color": "#14532d",
                    "fontSize": 13,
                    "borderColor": "#86efac"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "133af17b-5020-41ea-a5f2-09b1e80a5288",
                  "text": "[证明] Eq.trans",
                  "children": [],
                  "isExpanded": true,
                  "parentId": "2873e362-9a0e-4ffc-b755-8f58dd73121e",
                  "data": {
                    "note": "**层** 证明\n\n**类型** theorem\n\n**模块** `Init.Prelude`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\n∀ {α : Sort u} {a b c : α}, a = b → b = c → a = c\n```\n\n**文档**\nEquality is transitive: if `a = b` and `b = c` then `a = c`.\n\nBecause this is in the `Eq` namespace, if you have variables or expressions\n`h₁ : a = b` and `h₂ : b = c`, you can use `h₁.trans h₂ : a = c` as shorthand\nfor `Eq.trans h₁ h₂`.\n\nFor more information: [Equality](https://lean-lang.org/theorem_proving_in_lean4/quantifiers_and_equality.html#equality)",
                    "tags": [
                      "declaration",
                      "证明",
                      "theorem"
                    ]
                  },
                  "style": {
                    "background": "#f7fef9",
                    "color": "#14532d",
                    "fontSize": 13,
                    "borderColor": "#86efac"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "ea61537f-9dbf-4267-ae27-7cd84e22d138",
                  "text": "[证明] congr",
                  "children": [],
                  "isExpanded": true,
                  "parentId": "2873e362-9a0e-4ffc-b755-8f58dd73121e",
                  "data": {
                    "note": "**层** 证明\n\n**类型** theorem\n\n**模块** `Init.Prelude`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\n∀ {α : Sort u} {β : Sort v} {f₁ f₂ : α → β} {a₁ a₂ : α}, f₁ = f₂ → a₁ = a₂ → f₁ a₁ = f₂ a₂\n```\n\n**文档**\nCongruence in both function and argument. If `f₁ = f₂` and `a₁ = a₂` then\n`f₁ a₁ = f₂ a₂`. This only works for nondependent functions; the theorem\nstatement is more complex in the dependent case.\n\nFor more information: [Equality](https://lean-lang.org/theorem_proving_in_lean4/quantifiers_and_equality.html#equality)",
                    "tags": [
                      "declaration",
                      "证明",
                      "theorem"
                    ]
                  },
                  "style": {
                    "background": "#f7fef9",
                    "color": "#14532d",
                    "fontSize": 13,
                    "borderColor": "#86efac"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "a8321266-b363-4267-a968-76179ecedf12",
                  "text": "[证明] congrArg",
                  "children": [],
                  "isExpanded": true,
                  "parentId": "2873e362-9a0e-4ffc-b755-8f58dd73121e",
                  "data": {
                    "note": "**层** 证明\n\n**类型** theorem\n\n**模块** `Init.Prelude`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\n∀ {α : Sort u} {β : Sort v} {a₁ a₂ : α} (f : α → β), a₁ = a₂ → f a₁ = f a₂\n```\n\n**文档**\nCongruence in the function argument: if `a₁ = a₂` then `f a₁ = f a₂` for\nany (nondependent) function `f`. This is more powerful than it might look at first, because\nyou can also use a lambda expression for `f` to prove that\n`<something containing a₁> = <something containing a₂>`. This function is used\ninternally by tactics like `congr` and `simp` to apply equalities inside\nsubterms.\n\nFor more information: [Equality](https://lean-lang.org/theorem_proving_in_lean4/quantifiers_and_equality.html#equality)",
                    "tags": [
                      "declaration",
                      "证明",
                      "theorem"
                    ]
                  },
                  "style": {
                    "background": "#f7fef9",
                    "color": "#14532d",
                    "fontSize": 13,
                    "borderColor": "#86efac"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "63a2dc58-ea3b-4dc7-91df-baf0420afc30",
                  "text": "[证明] congrFun'",
                  "children": [],
                  "isExpanded": true,
                  "parentId": "2873e362-9a0e-4ffc-b755-8f58dd73121e",
                  "data": {
                    "note": "**层** 证明\n\n**类型** theorem\n\n**模块** `Init.Prelude`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\n∀ {α : Sort u} {β : Sort v} {f g : α → β}, f = g → ∀ (a : α), f a = g a\n```\n\n**文档**\nSimilar to `congrFun` but `β` does not depend on `α`.",
                    "tags": [
                      "declaration",
                      "证明",
                      "theorem"
                    ]
                  },
                  "style": {
                    "background": "#f7fef9",
                    "color": "#14532d",
                    "fontSize": 13,
                    "borderColor": "#86efac"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "a6ce0840-0c29-4f26-82cc-087d075e0acd",
                  "text": "[证明] eq_self",
                  "children": [],
                  "isExpanded": true,
                  "parentId": "2873e362-9a0e-4ffc-b755-8f58dd73121e",
                  "data": {
                    "note": "**层** 证明\n\n**类型** theorem\n\n**模块** `Init.SimpLemmas`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\n∀ {α : Sort u_1} (a : α), (a = a) = True\n```\n\n**文档**\n（无 docstring）",
