                  "text": "[陈述] Add",
                  "children": [],
                  "isExpanded": true,
                  "parentId": "100c45aa-b85a-4448-9bc8-97314e61ece9",
                  "data": {
                    "note": "**层** 陈述\n\n**类型** inductive\n\n**模块** `Init.Prelude`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\nType u → Type u\n```\n\n**文档**\nThe homogeneous version of `HAdd`: `a + b : α` where `a b : α`.",
                    "tags": [
