                {
                  "id": "3c1a5693-b7c7-4242-90af-a24bc1313ac8",
                  "text": "[证明] Add.mk",
                  "children": [],
                  "isExpanded": true,
                  "parentId": "100c45aa-b85a-4448-9bc8-97314e61ece9",
                  "data": {
                    "note": "**层** 证明\n\n**类型** constructor\n\n**模块** `Init.Prelude`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\n{α : Type u} → (α → α → α) → Add α\n```\n\n**文档**\n（无 docstring）",
                    "tags": [
                      "declaration",
                      "证明",
                      "constructor"
                    ]
                  },
                  "style": {
                    "background": "#f7fef9",
                    "color": "#14532d",
                    "fontSize": 13,
                    "borderColor": "#86efac"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "9fe25b00-970f-420c-a3e8-0aa1fc66a09d",
                  "text": "[陈述] HAdd",
                  "children": [],
                  "isExpanded": true,
                  "parentId": "100c45aa-b85a-4448-9bc8-97314e61ece9",
                  "data": {
                    "note": "**层** 陈述\n\n**类型** inductive\n\n**模块** `Init.Prelude`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\nType u → Type v → outParam (Type w) → Type (max (max u v) w)\n```\n\n**文档**\nThe notation typeclass for heterogeneous addition.\nThis enables the notation `a + b : γ` where `a : α`, `b : β`.",
                    "tags": [
                      "declaration",
                      "陈述",
                      "inductive"
                    ]
                  },
                  "style": {
                    "background": "#f8fbff",
                    "color": "#1e3a8a",
                    "fontSize": 13,
                    "borderColor": "#93c5fd"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "12599c29-77a8-4669-b591-0f9590618d5e",
                  "text": "[陈述] HAdd.hAdd",
                  "children": [],
                  "isExpanded": true,
                  "parentId": "100c45aa-b85a-4448-9bc8-97314e61ece9",
                  "data": {
                    "note": "**层** 陈述\n\n**类型** definition\n\n**模块** `Init.Prelude`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\n{α : Type u} → {β : Type v} → {γ : outParam (Type w)} → [self : HAdd α β γ] → α → β → γ\n```\n\n**文档**\n`a + b` computes the sum of `a` and `b`.\nThe meaning of this notation is type-dependent.",
                    "tags": [
                      "declaration",
                      "陈述",
                      "definition"
                    ]
                  },
                  "style": {
                    "background": "#f8fbff",
                    "color": "#1e3a8a",
                    "fontSize": 13,
                    "borderColor": "#93c5fd"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "47787313-c1f9-46a2-8342-9c5cce01b339",
                  "text": "[证明] HAdd.mk",
                  "children": [],
                  "isExpanded": true,
                  "parentId": "100c45aa-b85a-4448-9bc8-97314e61ece9",
                  "data": {
                    "note": "**层** 证明\n\n**类型** constructor\n\n**模块** `Init.Prelude`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\n{α : Type u} → {β : Type v} → {γ : outParam (Type w)} → (α → β → γ) → HAdd α β γ\n```\n\n**文档**\n（无 docstring）",
                    "tags": [
                      "declaration",
                      "证明",
                      "constructor"
                    ]
                  },
                  "style": {
                    "background": "#f7fef9",
                    "color": "#14532d",
                    "fontSize": 13,
                    "borderColor": "#86efac"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "d79f738d-cfc7-4511-a88e-19b78eba6a24",
                  "text": "[证明] OfNat",
                  "children": [],
                  "isExpanded": true,
                  "parentId": "100c45aa-b85a-4448-9bc8-97314e61ece9",
                  "data": {
                    "note": "**层** 证明\n\n**类型** inductive\n\n**模块** `Init.Prelude`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\nType u → ℕ → Type u\n```\n\n**文档**\nThe class `OfNat α n` powers the numeric literal parser. If you write\n`37 : α`, Lean will attempt to synthesize `OfNat α 37`, and will generate\nthe term `(OfNat.ofNat 37 : α)`.\n\nThere is a bit of infinite regress here since the desugaring apparently\nstill contains a literal `37` in it. The type of expressions contains a\nprimitive constructor for \"raw natural number literals\", which you can directly\naccess using the macro `nat_lit 37`. Raw number literals are always of type `Nat`.\nSo it would be more correct to say that Lean looks for an instance of\n`OfNat α (nat_lit 37)`, and it generates the term `(OfNat.ofNat (nat_lit 37) : α)`.",
                    "tags": [
                      "declaration",
                      "证明",
                      "inductive"
                    ]
                  },
                  "style": {
                    "background": "#f7fef9",
                    "color": "#14532d",
                    "fontSize": 13,
                    "borderColor": "#86efac"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "34d52718-71b5-408d-83c5-d48e5b4d4c3f",
                  "text": "[证明] OfNat.mk",
                  "children": [],
                  "isExpanded": true,
                  "parentId": "100c45aa-b85a-4448-9bc8-97314e61ece9",
                  "data": {
                    "note": "**层** 证明\n\n**类型** constructor\n\n**模块** `Init.Prelude`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\n{α : Type u} → {x : ℕ} → α → OfNat α x\n```\n\n**文档**\n（无 docstring）",
                    "tags": [
                      "declaration",
                      "证明",
                      "constructor"
                    ]
                  },
                  "style": {
                    "background": "#f7fef9",
                    "color": "#14532d",
                    "fontSize": 13,
                    "borderColor": "#86efac"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "ac1691d1-c245-4dd7-84bd-2c298fc3fcf6",
                  "text": "[证明] OfNat.ofNat",
                  "children": [],
                  "isExpanded": true,
                  "parentId": "100c45aa-b85a-4448-9bc8-97314e61ece9",
                  "data": {
                    "note": "**层** 证明\n\n**类型** definition\n\n**模块** `Init.Prelude`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\n{α : Type u} → (x : ℕ) → [self : OfNat α x] → α\n```\n\n**文档**\nThe `OfNat.ofNat` function is automatically inserted by the parser when\nthe user writes a numeric literal like `1 : α`. Implementations of this\ntypeclass can therefore customize the behavior of `n : α` based on `n` and\n`α`.",
                    "tags": [
                      "declaration",
                      "证明",
                      "definition"
                    ]
                  },
                  "style": {
                    "background": "#f7fef9",
                    "color": "#14532d",
                    "fontSize": 13,
                    "borderColor": "#86efac"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "9b692aa7-4e6c-4ed0-b85d-a2a6f154036e",
                  "text": "[陈述] instAddNat",
