                  "data": {
                    "note": "**层** 陈述\n\n**类型** inductive\n\n**模块** `Init.Prelude`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\nType u → Type v → outParam (Type w) → Type (max (max u v) w)\n```\n\n**文档**\nThe notation typeclass for heterogeneous append.\nThis enables the notation `a ++ b : γ` where `a : α`, `b : β`.",
                    "tags": [
                      "declaration",
