            {
              "id": "b5b45d55-3a83-4e92-9386-20928318f8cb",
              "text": "自然数与加法",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "21c2d8ce-5062-40f4-bdb7-10966e2cd1f4",
                  "text": "[陈述] Nat",
                  "children": [],
                  "isExpanded": true,
                  "parentId": "b5b45d55-3a83-4e92-9386-20928318f8cb",
                  "data": {
                    "note": "**层** 陈述\n\n**类型** inductive\n\n**模块** `Init.Prelude`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\nType\n```\n\n**文档**\nThe natural numbers, starting at zero.\n\nThis type is special-cased by both the kernel and the compiler, and overridden with an efficient\nimplementation. Both use a fast arbitrary-precision arithmetic library (usually\n[GMP](https://gmplib.org/)); at runtime, `Nat` values that are sufficiently small are unboxed.",
                    "tags": [
                      "declaration",
                      "陈述",
                      "inductive"
                    ]
                  },
                  "style": {
                    "background": "#f8fbff",
                    "color": "#1e3a8a",
                    "fontSize": 13,
                    "borderColor": "#93c5fd"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "c610ff8c-a505-4869-af47-37b9226081be",
                  "text": "[证明] Nat.add",
                  "children": [],
                  "isExpanded": true,
                  "parentId": "b5b45d55-3a83-4e92-9386-20928318f8cb",
                  "data": {
                    "note": "**层** 证明\n\n**类型** definition\n\n**模块** `Init.Prelude`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\nℕ → ℕ → ℕ\n```\n\n**文档**\nAddition of natural numbers, typically used via the `+` operator.\n\nThis function is overridden in both the kernel and the compiler to efficiently evaluate using the\narbitrary-precision arithmetic library. The definition provided here is the logical model.",
                    "tags": [
                      "declaration",
                      "证明",
                      "definition"
                    ]
                  },
                  "style": {
                    "background": "#f7fef9",
                    "color": "#14532d",
                    "fontSize": 13,
                    "borderColor": "#86efac"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "c0b27706-9069-4bb4-a5b1-b8ac9ea12fd7",
                  "text": "[证明] Nat.rec",
                  "children": [],
                  "isExpanded": true,
                  "parentId": "b5b45d55-3a83-4e92-9386-20928318f8cb",
                  "data": {
                    "note": "**层** 证明\n\n**类型** recursor\n\n**模块** `Init.Prelude`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\n{motive : ℕ → Sort u} → motive Nat.zero → ((n : ℕ) → motive n → motive n.succ) → (t : ℕ) → motive t\n```\n\n**文档**\n（无 docstring）",
                    "tags": [
                      "declaration",
                      "证明",
                      "recursor"
                    ]
                  },
                  "style": {
                    "background": "#f7fef9",
                    "color": "#14532d",
                    "fontSize": 13,
