              "parentId": "caa8ed91-bf54-49ce-b2af-ea3671204279",
              "data": {
                "note": "**概念** 逻辑与函数外延（True / Iff / propext / funext）\n\n**锚点** 6 个\n\n**概念依赖（聚焦内）**\n- 等式与同余（Eq / congr）：type 1 / proof 0",
                "tags": [
                  "concept",
                  "logic"
                ]
              },
              "style": {
                "background": "#f0fdf4",
                "color": "#166534",
                "fontWeight": "bold",
                "shape": "round",
                "borderColor": "#34d399"
              }
